  "description": "A disk-based, persistent Log-Structured Merge-tree for .NET 10. Provides a write-optimized sorted key-value store with WAL-based durability, leveled compaction, bloom-filter accelerated point lookups, and concurrent reads/writes. Keys and values are fully generic with custom codec support.",
